1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:08,080
Florida's controversial Stop Woke Act prohibited mandatory diversity, equity, and inclusion

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:12,440
training in the workplace. The DeSantis administration argued that this was merely

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:16,920
an attempt to prevent discriminatory conduct in the workplace and compared it to the Title

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:21,920
7 of the Civil Rights Act. But recently, the 11th Circuit Court of Appeals held the law

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:26,920
was classic viewpoint-based discrimination in violation of the First Amendment that regulates

6
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:32,800
speech, not conduct. For now, Florida employers may be able to host mandatory DEI training

7
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:37,940
for workers, but there may be further developments, including an appeal to the Supreme Court. So

8
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,500
stay tuned.

